Shall we pull it together?

12
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:05,869
We shall reach out to you,

13
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:10,000
We will continue to see you.

14
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:15,760
Our generation will always
go through the bright light.

15
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:20,017
We will always make an end.

16
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:21,700
Let's just continue.

17
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:41,700
Now then, let us begin the summit meeting.

18
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:47,147
First, we'll start with a macho status
report from our national representative.

19
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:53,665
Every freaking morning
with this cleaning crap.

20
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:57,260
But thanks to you, Yuki, we
at least get to take it easy.

21
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,760
Quit slacking off.

22
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:03,900
Oh, come on!

23
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:05,697
Just look at that shine, will you?

24
00:03:05,780 --> 00:03:09,817
Compared to your housekeeping skills,
we're just a couple of bumbling idiots.

25
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:12,377
Well, I guess I can't
really argue with you there.

26
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,290
Good morning!

27
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:17,777
Here come the girls
rolling in late, of course.

28
00:03:17,860 --> 00:03:19,000
It is what it is.

29
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:22,054
Peaches don't grant powers to us, guys.

30
00:03:22,420 --> 00:03:25,200
From day one, we're
playing life on hard mode.

31
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,830
Wakura!

32
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,212
Can you fix this for me?

33
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,480
Yeah, no problem.

34
