Well, it's too bad it doesn't
make me popular with the ladies.

36
00:03:39,060 --> 00:03:40,080
I appreciate it.

37
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:42,934
Hey, I didn't know you could sew, Yuki.

38
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,847
My big sister taught me how.

39
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,037
She said I ought to polish my skills since

40
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,177
