And when I didn't do it right,
she would put me in a headlock.

42
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,560
Poor pathetic bastard. Wait a minute.

43
00:03:54,740 --> 00:03:56,677
I thought that your big
sister had taught...

44
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:57,590
Shut it.

45
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:08,056
Almost time for me to start a career.

46
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,760
Is this all there is?

47
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:20,340
Work a normal job and live a normal life?

48
00:04:20,980 --> 00:04:21,810
No!

49
00:04:21,893 --> 00:04:24,137
There has to be something
better out there.

50
00:04:24,220 --> 00:04:26,985
A place where I can
actually make a difference.

51
