Wait, am I in?

55
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:51,530
Mato?

56
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:54,340
Okay, stay calm.

57
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:56,502
Where's that instruction manual?

58
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:59,740
Here's the information
I found on Mato mishaps.

59
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:03,637
Mato refers to an alternate dimension
accessible through gateways,

60
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,896
also known as doors,

61
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,997
that may suddenly appear throughout Japan.

62
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:09,677
Injuries may be sustained as
a result of Shuki entering

63
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:13,231
our world or by civilians
accidentally wandering into Mato.

64
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:15,077
If you find yourself in Mato,

65
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:18,957
stay where you are and wait for the
demon defense force to rescue you.

66
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:19,880
Okay, then.

67
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,904
I just have to stay right here.

68
00:05:26,020 --> 00:05:26,850
Oh.

69
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:39,690
Seriously?

70
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:55,500
Please, not here.

71
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:58,600
I don't want to die in a place like this!

72
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,440
A person?

73
