You've suffered a Mato mishap, correct?

74
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:13,551
You've got to be pretty unlucky
to get attacked so quickly.

75
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:18,380
Prepare yourselves, Vile Shuki.

76
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:20,640
You're going down!

77
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:44,030
Damn it!

78
00:06:44,113 --> 00:06:45,293
I knew it was too weak!

79
00:06:50,260 --> 00:06:51,090
Relax.

80
00:06:51,173 --> 00:06:52,080
I'm here to help.

81
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:56,040
Demon Defense Force
Commander, Kyoka Uthin.

82
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:00,999
Try to stay hidden behind me, okay?

83
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:07,572
Hey, um, things are getting
worse and worse by the second.

84
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:12,440
Hop on!

85
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,270
Now!

86
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:15,670
Right!

87
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,280
Thanks, by the way!

88
00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:24,480
Don't talk.

89
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,092
You'll bite your tongue.

90
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:35,470
Commander!

91
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:42,760
Himari Azuma, Nei Okawabara, and Shushu
Tsuruga, 7th Squadron, reporting for duty.

92
00:07:45,100 --> 00:07:46,160
Status report!

93
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:49,734
We've yet to locate any other
survivors in the vicinity.

94
00:07:50,080 --> 00:07:52,720
Expand the search radius. Yes, ma 'am.

95
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:03,177
A horde of Shuki are bearing down on us
coming from our six and nine o 'clock.

96
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:04,297
Handle them for me.

97
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:05,997
I'll get this survivor to safety.

98
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:06,910
Roger.

99
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:07,950
Hey, boy.

100
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,757
If you want to survive,

101
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:14,075
