follow the commander's orders to a T.

102
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:20,120
Get out of my way!

103
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:37,097
And of all the women who've gained powers

104
00:08:37,180 --> 00:08:39,737
from the peaches that
grow exclusively in Mato,

105
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:42,702
