when it comes to combat.

106
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:45,120
The Demon Defense Force.

107
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:54,880
I've only heard rumors.

108
00:08:55,540 --> 00:08:56,820
But here they are!

109
00:09:04,540 --> 00:09:05,952
That takes care of that.

110
