Is he alright?

111
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:10,660
He's unconscious, but he
doesn't have any injuries.

112
00:09:10,780 --> 00:09:11,820
Nice job, Nei.

113
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:14,137
We couldn't have found him without you.

114
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:15,817
Hang in there just a little longer.

115
00:09:15,900 --> 00:09:16,840
Okay, I'll try.

116
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:18,720
Man, that fight wore me out.

117
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,057
Stamina isn't your forte, is it?

118
00:09:21,140 --> 00:09:22,260
That's funny.

119
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:24,457
The commander tells me that all the time.

120
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:28,658
Hey, do you think the commander and
that boy are back at the dorm yet?

121
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,110
Probably.

122
00:09:30,193 --> 00:09:31,023
We can't go back yet.

123
00:09:31,220 --> 00:09:32,917
We've got this kid to tend to.

124
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,177
Let's hurry up and get the
last sight checked out.

125
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:36,090
Sure thing.

126
00:09:36,173 --> 00:09:37,003
That works for me.

127
00:09:37,086 --> 00:09:37,916
Hey, Mari.

128
00:09:37,999 --> 00:09:40,657
We missed out on seeing the
commander's sword skills.

129
00:09:40,740 --> 00:09:44,820
An unfortunate yet necessary
evil. Oh, good. You're awake now.

130
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:47,457
