the following three measures.

135
00:09:57,900 --> 00:10:00,300
One, hold your breath and await rescue.

136
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:01,790
Two,

137
00:10:01,873 --> 00:10:03,087
if you happen across Ashuki,

138
00:10:03,180 --> 00:10:06,637
prioritize personal safety and
run as far away as possible.

139
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:09,602
And the third measure is
to keep your mouth shut.

140
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,220
