148
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,791
There's no need to panic.

149
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,550
But...

150
00:11:03,780 --> 00:11:06,662
If I was alone, it wouldn't
matter how this ends.

151
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,380
The Peach's gift.

152
00:11:11,780 --> 00:11:14,545
Even I know I got stuck
with the lousy ability.

153
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:19,540
Sure, Kyoka's strong, but
look at what her ability is.

154
00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:21,677
She'll never be Supreme Commander.

155
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:23,113
Not in a million years.

156
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:24,520
I'll show them.

157
00:11:24,940 --> 00:11:29,293
I will become the Supreme Commander
in charge of all the other commanders.

158
00:11:32,220 --> 00:11:34,080
I've never tested it on a man.

159
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:36,337
I always thought it'd be impractical.

160
00:11:36,420 --> 00:11:38,067
I've got a decision to make.

161
00:11:38,620 --> 00:11:40,300
Hey, what's your name?

162
00:11:40,820 --> 00:11:41,740
I'm Wakura.

163
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:42,840
Yuki Wakura.

164
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:48,860
Yuki, in order for us to escape, there's
something I need you to do. What? Really?

165
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:51,236
I'll do whatever it takes to survive.

166
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:53,357
I like your attitude.

167
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:56,734
In that case, starting now,
you're going to be my slave.

168
00:11:58,520 --> 00:12:00,937
Hello, can you give us
a little room, sweetie?

169
00:12:01,020 --> 00:12:02,857
And I need you to close your eyes.

170
00:12:02,940 --> 00:12:04,660
Okay, sure. Thank you.

171
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:11,677
If you have enhanced strength, we'll have
a shot at making it out of here alive.

172
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:17,697
Huh you want me to fight those things I
can't do that you said you'd do whatever!

173
00:12:17,780 --> 00:12:18,657
It takes to survive

174
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:19,570
right

175
00:12:19,653 --> 00:12:26,080
it's

176
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:27,270
time to

177
00:12:27,353 --> 00:12:32,417
bow down then despite never even having

178
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:38,037
Touched a girl before on instinct as
if it were only logical she held out a?

179
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:40,600
a finger towards me, and I licked it.

180
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,350
Yuki.

181
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:19,260
Did that boy turn into
the commander's slave?

182
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,790
Incredible.

183
00:13:32,873 --> 00:13:34,954
I didn't think it would work this well.

184
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:42,437
It's time for you to
show me what you can do!

185
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,350
Go, Yuki!

186
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:10,620
Jump to the left!

187
00:14:14,940 --> 00:14:16,440
He's fast as lightning!

188
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:20,980
Take care of her!

189
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:23,820
You got it! Fix this! Ryota!

190
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:26,170
Commander!

191
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,520
That's huge!

192
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:34,900
I'll tie up the loose ends.

193
00:14:35,100 --> 00:14:36,577
You and the kids take cover.

194
00:14:36,660 --> 00:14:37,490
Yes, ma 'am!

195
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:39,680
Get in there, Yuki!

196
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:42,294
Use your strength and crush that thing!

197
00:15:00,940 --> 00:15:01,770
Amazing!

198
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,180
Who the hell is he?

199
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:09,153
Where did he come from?

200
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:22,620
Where the heck did that come from?

201
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:24,730
Commander!

202
00:15:24,813 --> 00:15:25,917
Head back without me.

203
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:26,830
What?

204
00:15:26,913 --> 00:15:28,876
He and I need to have a conversation.

205
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:31,500
Yes, of course.

206
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,440
You surprised me.

207
00:15:34,620 --> 00:15:37,097
I never would have
guessed you had it in you.

208
00:15:37,180 --> 00:15:41,240
Perhaps we should make your job as
my slave a permanent arrangement.

209
00:15:41,500 --> 00:15:43,417
A permanent slave?!

210
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:47,618
But before that, there's a caveat
to my ability we'll need to discuss.

211
00:15:58,580 --> 00:16:00,740
So that's how it's going to be, huh?

212
00:16:01,640 --> 00:16:02,470
What?

213
00:16:02,553 --> 00:16:03,937
The price of my ability.

214
00:16:04,020 --> 00:16:05,540
As the master,

215
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:08,817
I must compensate my slave
with a reward befitting

216
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:12,080
their work each time they
carry out a task. A reward?

217
00:16:12,580 --> 00:16:14,900
My reward is a kiss?

218
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:17,720
You worked very hard out there.

219
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:19,540
Would you like another one?

220
00:16:19,820 --> 00:16:21,237
No, no, I think I'm good.

221
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:24,732
You're the one who saved my
life, so there's no need to...

222
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,860
Look, I'm sorry.

223
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:34,977
I never expected something
like this to happen either.

224
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:39,217
When those Shuki were my slaves, they
were happy being paid in slices of pork.

225
00:16:39,300 --> 00:16:40,577
Hey, what are you doing?

226
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:45,177
My body moves automatically regardless of
how I feel, and there's nothing I can do.

227
00:16:45,260 --> 00:16:47,040
It's the price of my ability.

228
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:50,536
I'm usually indifferent
towards this type of behavior.

229
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:21,880
We successfully recovered two survivors.

230
00:17:22,580 --> 00:17:24,357
Please stand by for extraction.

231
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:25,270
Roger that.

232
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,660
My first kiss.

233
00:17:32,020 --> 00:17:34,549
Who'd have thought it
would happen in Mato?

234
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:38,300
The Shuki.

235
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:39,730
Huh?

236
00:17:39,813 --> 00:17:42,717
If even one of them were to
appear in the real world,

237
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:44,918
there would be dozens of casualties.

238
00:17:45,420 --> 00:17:48,437
My goal is to become Supreme
Commander of the Demon

239
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:51,755
Defense Force and exterminate
those creatures for good.

240
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,917
Our current commander is too lenient.

241
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:57,577
With your help, I believe I can
make the most out of my ability.

242
00:17:57,660 --> 00:18:00,937
Actually, I think I'm in the
running for the position now.

243
00:18:01,020 --> 00:18:03,000
Please, come work for me, Yuki.

244
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:10,540
I'm not particularly good at
stuff like sports or academics.

245
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:14,717
My housekeeping skills are the only
thing I have confidence in, but...

246
00:18:14,800 --> 00:18:17,877
I'm all for a guy who knows
how to keep things clean!

247
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:19,380
But there's more to you.

248
00:18:19,540 --> 00:18:22,011
You risked your life to protect that girl.

249
00:18:23,180 --> 00:18:25,520
I suppose you aren't so bad for a man.

250
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:31,330
Well...

251
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:34,300
Then in that case, yes!

252
00:18:34,820 --> 00:18:36,660
I want to be a hero in Mato!

253
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:40,480
Then it's settled.

254
00:18:43,020 --> 00:18:45,255
Even if I get a job in the real world,

255
00:18:45,340 --> 00:18:48,575
all it's waiting for me is
a life of boring mediocrity.

256
00:18:49,180 --> 00:18:52,400
But in this world, I can
fight against the Shuki.

257
00:18:55,420 --> 00:18:58,100
And I can avenge my big sister's death.

258
00:19:00,540 --> 00:19:05,660
Plus, as long as I get my reward from
Miss Kyoka, then it will all be worth it.

259
00:19:12,980 --> 00:19:15,360
This is the Demon Defense Force's dorm?

260
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:20,171
It kind of reminds me of an old-timey inn.

261
00:19:21,460 --> 00:19:24,697
It was built according to Mato's
unique mystical properties.

262
00:19:24,780 --> 00:19:27,309
It's also surrounded
by a powerful barrier.

263
00:19:29,180 --> 00:19:32,177
This is where we deal with
all the boring red tape.

264
00:19:32,260 --> 00:19:33,319
Let's head inside.

